{
  "movie_id": 513200601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 7.2,
      "end_time": 9.5,
      "text": "Rebooting complete"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 11.5,
      "end_time": 15.5,
      "text": "From here on, we will resume our activities to achieve happiness."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 17.1,
      "end_time": 20.2,
      "text": "Well then everyone, Merry Christmas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 20.4,
      "end_time": 22.2,
      "text": "Happy Holidays!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 25.4,
      "end_time": 26.3,
      "text": "Nom"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 26.6,
      "end_time": 28.2,
      "text": "*munch munch munch*"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 28.4,
      "end_time": 29.2,
      "text": "Nom"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 29.5,
      "end_time": 31.1,
      "text": "*munch munch*"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 34.5,
      "end_time": 36.1,
      "text": "Pwah~"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 39.7,
      "end_time": 41.4,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 42.1,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "Your Majesty!? What on earth has happened to you!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 45.4,
      "end_time": 47.0,
      "text": "Could it be that there is poison in the food..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 47.2,
      "end_time": 48.0,
      "text": "That's not it."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 48.2,
      "end_time": 49.0,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 49.3,
      "end_time": 52.3,
      "text": "It was just so delicious, I was overjoyed..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 52.6,
      "end_time": 53.6,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 54.4,
      "end_time": 58.3,
      "text": "I listened to Saren and you guys talk about Christmas"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 58.6,
      "end_time": 61.6,
      "text": "I've always been jealous of you."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 62.2,
      "end_time": 66.5,
      "text": "I also want to experience such a special Christmas."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 67.1,
      "end_time": 70.4,
      "text": "Well, I think they're pretty special examples..."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 70.6,
      "end_time": 75.3,
      "text": "I'm technically a princess, so I'm quite greedy"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 75.6,
      "end_time": 78.8,
      "text": "There are so many things I want to do that\nI end up causing trouble."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 79.0,
      "end_time": 81.6,
      "text": "So I thought, I can't give up"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 82.2,
      "end_time": 87.0,
      "text": "But I had so many dreams come true"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 87.6,
      "end_time": 89.6,
      "text": "I had so many granted"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 90.5,
      "end_time": 94.6,
      "text": "I was also told that I can make a wish"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 95.5,
      "end_time": 101.1,
      "text": "Not just for myself, but also for the people of the city,\nand for everyone important"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 101.4,
      "end_time": 105.6,
      "text": "A happy Christmas that is delicious and fun..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 106.6,
      "end_time": 111.0,
      "text": "I just did what was expected of me as a loyal subject, that's all."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 111.5,
      "end_time": 116.3,
      "text": "Likewise, Your Majesty. It is an honor for me to be able to assist you with your Christmas preparations."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 117.1,
      "end_time": 118.2,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 118.6,
      "end_time": 120.8,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 121.4,
      "end_time": 128.2,
      "text": "Even so, truly, truly... Thank you very much!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 128.4,
      "end_time": 130.6,
      "text": "Ueeeeee"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 131.3,
      "end_time": 135.1,
      "text": "Is this not a happy Christmas...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 138.2,
      "end_time": 140.2,
      "text": "...With all due respect, Your Majesty."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 140.5,
      "end_time": 144.1,
      "text": "The joyful Christmas is not yet complete, you know."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 146.3,
      "end_time": 151.5,
      "text": "You've thrown me for a loop a lot, but for now, I am grateful to you."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 152.2,
      "end_time": 154.1,
      "text": "All's well that ends well so"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 154.7,
      "end_time": 157.1,
      "text": "Now, please come this way."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 157.6,
      "end_time": 160.1,
      "text": "Because I feel unsatisfied when you're not here."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 160.6,
      "end_time": 164.9,
      "text": "There are still plenty of delicious treats.\nLet's enjoy them together ☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 166.2,
      "end_time": 169.5,
      "text": "...Manifesting Happiness... Commence operation"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 176.6,
      "end_time": 179.0,
      "text": "...What was that just now...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 179.3,
      "end_time": 180.3,
      "text": "Ah!"
    }
  ],
